        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fat Cat Fest is a <strong>two player</strong> party game where you can laugh while you compete in a food contest with various minigames. <br>You can choose your favorite cat from our 5 furry friends.<br> <br><strong>EAT, EAT, AND EAT TO WIN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friend to see who's faster while you enjoy typical Colombian dishes.<br>The first to finish the meals will be the winner, so be sure to have an empty stomach before you start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIN IN MINIGAMES BETWEEN MEALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in 7 different minigames that will appear randomly between meals, and whoever wins will have an advantage to get closer to victory!    <br>These minigames are frenetic and short, easy to understand but hard to dominate. You'll have to be on your toes if you want to win!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS ( CAT FRIENDLY )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, anyone can eat, you only need a joystick and a button. Even our cats could handle it! We recommend playing with two different controllers, but you can use only a keyboard if you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MEET THE CATS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Timmy                                                            Miguel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/96cf2271ae96baa73d5faa579480d2a0.avif?t=1762797756\" width=564 height=243 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chad                                                                           Cejon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/acdc665d4604666d61654e588860141c.avif?t=1762797756\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fat Cat Fest is a <strong>two player</strong> party game where you can laugh while you compete in a food contest with various minigames. <br>You can choose your favorite cat from our 5 furry friends.<br> <br><strong>EAT, EAT, AND EAT TO WIN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friend to see who's faster while you enjoy typical Colombian dishes.<br>The first to finish the meals will be the winner, so be sure to have an empty stomach before you start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/0776fc1e2d510fefd35f0c628c4d6068.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIN IN MINIGAMES BETWEEN MEALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in 7 different minigames that will appear randomly between meals, and whoever wins will have an advantage to get closer to victory!    <br>These minigames are frenetic and short, easy to understand but hard to dominate. You'll have to be on your toes if you want to win!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/76aa2344279417ae44448f371338c21e.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS ( CAT FRIENDLY )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, anyone can eat, you only need a joystick and a button. Even our cats could handle it! We recommend playing with two different controllers, but you can use only a keyboard if you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.poster.avif?t=1762797756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.webm?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/b56df7f1078d6cb1a325bc9259238919.mp4?t=1762797756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MEET THE CATS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Timmy                                                            Miguel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259080/extras/96cf2271ae96baa73d5faa579480d2a0.avif?t=1762797756\" width=564 height=243 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chad                                                                           Cejon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class